# 7. Priority (Severity Levels)

Har log message ki ek severity level hoti hai.

Jitni severity upar hogi utna message zyada important hoga.

| Priority | Matlab |
|-----------|---------|
| `emerg` | System bilkul unusable hai |
| `alert` | Foran action lena zaroori hai |
| `crit` | Critical problem |
| `err` | Error |
| `warning` | Warning |
| `notice` | Normal lekin important |
| `info` | Information |
| `debug` | Debugging information |

---

# 8. Wildcard (*)

Asterisk (`*`) ko **Wildcard** kehte hain.

Is ka matlab hota hai:

> **Har value ko match karo.**

Example:

```text
authpriv.*
```

Matlab:

Authentication facility ki har priority.

---

# 9. Example 1

```text
authpriv.*    /var/log/secure
```

Explanation:

| Part | Matlab |
|------|---------|
| `authpriv` | Authentication facility |
| `*` | Har priority |
| `/var/log/secure` | Destination log file |

Ye rule tamam authentication messages ko:

```text
/var/log/secure
```

mein store karega.

---

# 10. Example 2

```text
*.info;mail.none;authpriv.none;cron.none    /var/log/messages
```

Ye Red Hat systems mein bohot common rule hai.

Isay step by step samajhte hain.

---

## Part 1

```text
*.info
```

Matlab:

Har facility ke **Info level aur us se upar** wale messages.

---

## Part 2

```text
mail.none
```

Matlab:

Mail logs ko include mat karo.

---

## Part 3

```text
authpriv.none
```

Matlab:

Authentication logs ko include mat karo.

---

## Part 4

```text
cron.none
```

Matlab:

Cron logs ko include mat karo.

---

## Destination

```text
/var/log/messages
```

Baqi tamam logs is file mein save honge.

---

# 11. Is Rule Ka Simple Matlab

```text
*.info;mail.none;authpriv.none;cron.none    /var/log/messages
```

Simple alfaaz mein:

Har facility ke **Info level aur us se upar** wale messages ko `/var/log/messages` mein save karo.

Lekin:

- Mail logs nahi
- Authentication logs nahi
- Cron logs nahi

---

# 12. Keyword "none"

Keyword:

```text
none
```

ka matlab hota hai:

> **Is facility ko ignore karo.**

Example:

```text
mail.none
```

Matlab:

Mail logs ko skip karo.

