# 13. Logging Flow

```text
Application
      │
      ▼
Log Generate Hota Hai
      │
      ▼
Facility Assign Hoti Hai
      │
      ▼
Priority Assign Hoti Hai
      │
      ▼
rsyslog Rule Read Karta Hai
      │
      ▼
Sahi Log File Mein Store Kar Deta Hai
```

---

# 14. Facilities Ki Importance

Facilities Linux ko help karti hain ke har type ke logs ko alag rakha jaye.

Misal ke taur par:

- Authentication logs alag
- Cron logs alag
- Mail logs alag
- Kernel logs alag

Is se troubleshooting bohot aasaan ho jati hai.

---

# 15. Priorities Ki Importance

Priorities administrator ko batati hain ke:

- Konsa issue critical hai.
- Konsa sirf warning hai.
- Konsa error hai.
- Konsa informational message hai.
- Konsa debugging message hai.

Agar priorities na hotin to har message ek jaisa lagta.

