# 19. Key Takeaways

- Har log message ke andar **Facility** aur **Priority** hoti hai.
- Facility batati hai message kis source se aya hai.
- Priority batati hai message kitna important hai.
- `rsyslog` apni configuration ko read karke decide karta hai ke log kis file mein store karna hai.
- Facilities aur priorities ki wajah se Linux ke logs bohot achi tarah organize rehte hain.

---

# 💡 Yaad Rakhein

> **Linux Logging bilkul Post Office ki tarah kaam karti hai.**
>
> - **Facility** batati hai ke **message kis ne bheja hai.**
> - **Priority** batati hai ke **message kitna urgent hai.**
> - **rsyslog** decide karta hai ke **ye message kis log file (mailbox) mein jana chahiye.**